#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:132
msgid ""
"API tokens can be used to authenticate 3rd-party applications against the "
"REST API. <strong>Please treat tokens as you would any other "
"credential.</strong> Any party with access to a token can access and manage "
"all your bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Les jetons d'API permettent d'authentifier des applications tierces auprès "
"de l'API REST. <strong>Traitez les jetons comme n'importe quel autre "
"identifiant.</strong> Toute personne disposant d'un jeton peut accéder à "
"tous vos signets et les gérer."

